"""Regenerate the libdtfl port and test ledgers from the pinned upstreams.

Usage: dev/ledger-diff [--write]

Lists every upstream file and #[test] at the pins in PIN, maps each new
path to a target with RULES, and compares against dev/port-ledger.tsv
and dev/test-ledger.tsv.  Rows that already exist keep their target,
phase, status and note; only the line count is refreshed.  Without
--write it prints added and removed rows and exits 1 if there are any.
With --write it rewrites both ledgers.

Upstream checkouts are expected under ~/src/.  Moving a pin means
editing PIN here and PLAN.md section 2 in the same commit.
"""
